  "footer": "<b>Same for both options:</b> the words are today's (Black Belt's text.js). Prospects' line adds a second sentence (“Email and form answers are hidden on this tablet.”). Black Belt could add one too, e.g. “Payments are hidden on this tablet.”, as a separate small change if you want it. With the line on screen, pressing the grayed button no longer shows a toast (v1.004: toasts only say something was done). The line goes away as soon as Hide private details is turned off. <b>When both reasons apply</b> (Hide private details on <b>and</b> the cycle finished), only one line shows: “Add new candidates at the desk.” (the order CyclePage.jsx already uses to pick the reason)."
}